  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the EU Regulation on Biomethane into Ukrainian Legislation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed activity aims to support the development of Ukrainian legislation in line with Directive (EU) 2024/1788. Its core objectives are also to ensure regulatory alignment with RED II and RED III, integrate sustainability criteria for feedstock as set in Annex IX of RED II.The initiative further seeks to establish support mechanisms for biomethane production from waste and residues, foster the development of the domestic biomethane market, promote its use in the transport sector, and enable certified exports to the EU.</narrative>
  </description>
